    "title": "8-2-3-10. Withdrawal of applications.",
    "summary": "An application may be withdrawn by the Applicant at any time. To reinitiate review, the Applicant shall resubmit the application, which in all respects shall be treated as a new application for purposes of review and scheduling.",
